## Premise

Guide ferry lamps along a storm-lit pier. Keep every light burning until the tide turns.

## Loop

Light three posts on a tiny pier map; lore cards before and after key beats.

## Session target

A short vertical slice with title, premise, lore, and play – depth over a two-minute empty loop.

